 qemu-server (9.2.20) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * fix #8331: snapshot: limit the wait for QEMU to finish the 'savevm-end'
     command to 35 seconds. After saving the VM state and RAM failed, the
     snapshot task waited endlessly and kept the VM locked. For VMs running
     with pve-qemu-kvm 11.1.3-3 or newer, the task checks directly whether the
     command finished and does not run into the timeout.
 
